From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: keptuve <keptuve@keptuve.k>
Date: Tue, 9 Dec 2025 14:44:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] import and export bookmarks feature

Adds "Import bookmarks" and "Export bookmarks" menu items to the
bookmarks page.

We extend BookmarkBridge to call a trimmed-down ProfileImport service on
Android and add a helper to drive HTML import/export file selection.

This version folds in the current M149 adaptations:
- Android-specific utility-process display name and localized string set
- the narrower importer build graph used by current Chromium
- the current BookmarkBridge / toolbar wiring
- the Android zh-CN resource string for "Bookmarks HTML File"
---
